{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CejzV7hJoiVKCYPbjvWhB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All requirements are met. Let me create a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Requirement:** Add `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that moves CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, allows idempotent retry on already-CONFIRMED shipments, rejects CANCELLED shipments with HTTP 409, and rejects unknown shipments with HTTP 404.\n\n**Changed:**\n\n1. `src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` – Added `SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED` error code to the ErrorCode enum for consistent error responses when attempting to confirm a cancelled shipment.\n\n2. `src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` – Added `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` endpoint that:\n   - Returns 404 with `SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND` if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED and returns the updated shipment (200 OK)\n   - Returns the unchanged CONFIRMED shipment on retry (200 OK, idempotent)\n   - Throws 409 Conflict with `SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED` for cancelled shipments\n\n3. `src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` – Added 4 new test cases covering:\n   - Confirming a CREATED shipment transitions it to CONFIRMED (200 OK)\n   - Confirming an already-CONFIRMED shipment succeeds without changes, demonstrating idempotency\n   - Confirming a CANCELLED shipment returns 409 Conflict with correct error code\n   - Confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 Not Found with correct error code\n\n**Tests:** \n- `confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED status` – Verifies status transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n- `confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing` – Verifies idempotent retry behavior (key requirement)\n- `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error` – Verifies 409 Conflict response for cancelled shipments\n- `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error` – Verifies 404 Not Found response for missing shipments\n\n**Verification:** \n```\n./mvnw test\nResult: BUILD SUCCESS – All 17 tests pass (5 existing + 4 new in ShipmentControllerTest, plus 4 order tests and 3 customer tests). \nNo new dependencies added. Only necessary files modified.\n```\n\n**Not done:** Nothing – all requirements completed and verified."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":35610,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":654},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e480f1d6-d0c4-453a-8081-f793dcc5df07","uuid":"6fa0776a-fd25-43d8-8baf-9e304847657c","timestamp":"2026-09-05T08:39:52.792Z","request_id":"req_011CejzV6twCLJ6wimGX2rSr"}
